  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">新增分析器，直觀掌握您的 ME 網路運作狀況。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組靈感源自 AE2Stuff 的網路視覺化工具。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以視覺化查看所有 ME 裝置的狀態。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1531/128/showoff.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"475\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您還能自訂顯示畫面。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/789/484/gui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"733\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您也可以視覺化分析您的網路效能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1445/86/showoff_tick.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"672\"></span></p>",
